Brand name trademark search
title end

section start
title start
Abstract
title end

paragraph start
Question: where can the names SHAPE, SHAPESHIFTER and ARCHITECT be searched for existing trademarks at no cost. Method: a web search for free trademark databases, read on 2026-10-29. Result: sources describe the WIPO Global Brand Database and TMview, run by the EUIPO, as free tools that search many national registers at once, with Madrid Monitor for international registrations. Limit: the sources are secondary, and a database search is a first screen, not legal clearance.
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Introduction
title end

paragraph start
A name used on every platform and on products can collide with a registered mark. This page records a search method, not a legal opinion.
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Methods
title end

paragraph start
Searched the web once for free trademark databases and read the results. No search of the three names was run here.
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Results
title end

paragraph start
The WIPO Global Brand Database is free and searches trademark data from several national and international sources by text or image (Rutgers library guide, secondary).
paragraph end

paragraph start
TMview is operated by the EUIPO, is free, and combines data from many participating offices including the USPTO (secondary sources, 2026).
paragraph end

paragraph start
A secondary article states that no single global trademark register exists, so a search should start broad and then move to the national registers of the countries where the brand will sell.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Madrid Monitor tracks the status of international registrations (secondary source).
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Discussion
title end

paragraph start
Search the exact names, spelling variants and sound alikes in the goods and services classes that fit content, social media and merchandise. A clear result means no obvious conflict was found, not that the name is safe.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A trademark lawyer should confirm the result before products are sold under the name.
paragraph end

paragraph start
todo: choose the countries and classes to search, run the search on the official sites and record the results
Not measured yet.
paragraph end

